msgctxt "96"
msgid "I apologize... but Serena's closed for the day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "108"
msgid "Wasn't that a bit too harsh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "120"
msgid "Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132"
msgid "Date-san was serious, you know. His heart was in that ring."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "144"
msgid "Did I ever tell you... I was married once?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "156"
msgid "No..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168"
msgid "Well. It was a long time ago."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180"
msgid "So that means... you're divorced?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "192"
msgid "No... That's not what happened at all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid "Then..."
msgstr "Allora..."

msgctxt "216"
msgid "My husband... He died."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid "He was a police officer, you know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid "Really..."
msgstr "Davvero...?"

msgctxt "264"
msgid "Date-san was, too, right? A detective?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr "Sì."

msgctxt "288"
msgid ""
"Well... I suppose I should fill you in. One day, I was... let's just say I "
"was in the wrong place at the wrong time, and a robber took me hostage."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid "Really... How did you make it out?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid "...It was my husband. He sacrificed his life for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "336"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid ""
"Look, I know Date-san left the force to be a journalist, but there's just "
"something about him that makes me think of my husband... It's too much for "
"me to handle."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "372"
msgid "Maybe they might be similar in some way, but Date-san's his own man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "384"
msgid "Even so... I just can't erase that horrible memory."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "396"
msgid ""
"Every time I think about Date-san as a detective, images of what happened "
"that day flash through my mind... and I just can't block them out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "408"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "420"
msgid "That's why I can't see him... Please tell him I'm sorry."
msgstr ""

